::page[route="/" title="Bikes"]

::hero[align=center]
# Ride the coast path at your own pace
A Coast Path Day Pass gets you a tuned bike, a helmet and a map of the best stops.
[Reserve a bike](/contact){primary}
[See prices](/prices)
::

::features[cols=3]
### Well kept bikes
Every bike is serviced weekly by our own mechanics.
### Helmet and lock
A Coast Path Day Pass includes a helmet, a lock and a repair kit.
### Open early
We open at seven so you can beat the afternoon wind.
::

::

::page[route="/pricing" title="Pricing"]

# Hire prices

All hires include a helmet and a lock.

::pricing-table
| Option | Price | Includes |
|--------|-------|----------|
| Coast Path Day Pass | $28 | One bike from seven to six |
| Half Day Hire | $19 | One bike for four hours |
| Electric Bike Day | $54 | One electric bike with a charged battery |
::

::faq
### Do you have child seats?
Yes. Child seats and trailers are free with any hire.
### Is a deposit required?
We hold a card on file but take no deposit.
### Can I return the bike late?
Late returns are charged at the half day rate.
::

